<title>MALAYSIA: United Plantations year net down 5.2 pct.</title>
<headline>United Plantations year net down 5.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  49.85   vs	  52.58</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 32.90   vs	  34.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		   209.97   vs	 264.48</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    71.73   vs	  79.90</p>
<p>    Minorities		    -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Final dividend (pct)    20.0    vs	  20.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's United Plantations Bhd cultivates and processes palm oil, copra and other commodities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
